00:05:45,360 --> 00:05:52,700
 So by temporal data I mean the time series data or where the things have sequences.

63
00:05:52,700 --> 00:05:58,240
 For example the natural language text which is a very good example of sequence data because

64
00:05:58,240 --> 00:06:03,640
 the words are dependent and if you change the word the order of different words then

65
00:06:03,640 --> 00:06:06,240
 they can carry different meanings.

